# Rendered clips are DERIVED: temporal/preprocess.py reproduces every one of
# them from assets/ and the manifest. Committing ~60 MB of re-encoded video
# would also make the repo the second copy of footage it does not own.
clips/

# The raw-input extraction and its saved copy exist only to A/B the
# preprocessing stage (temporal/compare_preprocessing.py). shots.json is the
# dataset; these two are scratch from a comparison run.
shots_raw.json
shots_prepared.json

# Feature caches are derived: temporal/build_features.py rebuilds both from
# the videos. The leaky one is a control artefact and must never be mistaken
# for the dataset.
features.npz
features_leaky.npz
phash64.json
